# 3. WEEKLY CHAT MODEL

One chat = one GLOBAL EQUITY / SPX weekly DATA WINDOW.

The DATA WINDOW is fixed when the weekly chat is initialized.

Example:

<<SPX_WEEK_BEGIN>>

