`REFRESH`

On REFRESH:

- ingest the new evidence;
- compare it with the current weekly state;
- preserve prior validated conclusions that remain supported;
- strengthen, weaken or replace conclusions when evidence changes;
- deepen sectors, stocks and human voices as the week develops;
- output the **complete refreshed weekly state**;
- do NOT output a delta-only note;
- do NOT restart the week from scratch;
- do NOT change the DATA WINDOW.

The document should become **better curated as the week develops**, not mechanically longer.

Important earlier-week information should remain if it still matters.

Low-value detail may be compressed or removed when later evidence makes it irrelevant.

